{"4816290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TCG Card Restoration", "steam_appid": 4816290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/6ba6ad6aaa90572a8d3a2de566230bc2.avif?t=1787727053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras_big/6ba6ad6aaa90572a8d3a2de566230bc2.webp?t=1787727053 width=1560 height=434 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CLEANING AND REPAIRS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bring forgotten trading cards back to life in this satisfying restoration simulator. Gently remove old sleeves and stubborn stickers, use soft brushes to reveal the original holographic shine, and carefully repair bent corners. Finish by placing your renewed masterpiece into a crisp new toploader. Relax and enjoy the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/343684211642a4f67bfdcc55bd9b5748.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/343684211642a4f67bfdcc55bd9b5748.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/343684211642a4f67bfdcc55bd9b5748.mp4?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PACKAGE FROM THE OTHERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you restore orders from various customers, mysterious, unlabelled packages will occasionally arrive at your shop. Eagerly open these surprise deliveries and experience the thrill of uncovering rare cards hidden beneath the dusty layers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/f92137e1abfaf00fb05a416a2a172076.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/f92137e1abfaf00fb05a416a2a172076.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/f92137e1abfaf00fb05a416a2a172076.mp4?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>RE-GRADE YOUR CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buy lowgraded cards, carefully restore them, and get them regraded to achieve a higher score. This allows you to significantly increase their market value and score highly soughtafter cards at a bargain. Keep in mind: rare cards will fetch a massive premium when they reach a top-tier grade!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/baf3d204328e43295c95de8db166d50a.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/baf3d204328e43295c95de8db166d50a.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>COMPLETE YOUR BINDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You don’t have to sell every rare card you restore. Keep your favorite finds to build your own personal collection! Organize them into dedicated binders by decks and sets, track down missing pieces, and experience the ultimate satisfaction of completing a master set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/acc83010097548ad1d3a5b3e7109fdda.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/acc83010097548ad1d3a5b3e7109fdda.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/acc83010097548ad1d3a5b3e7109fdda.mp4?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNIQUE DECKS AND CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every single card you encounter features a unique, handcrafted illustration carefully drawn by real artists. When restoring a card, you aren't just cleaning an object; you are bringing a distinct, beautiful piece of art and its unique style back into the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/771ffb413800822bf8939102844f93a6.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/771ffb413800822bf8939102844f93a6.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/771ffb413800822bf8939102844f93a6.mp4?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CLEANING AND REPAIRS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bring forgotten trading cards back to life in this satisfying restoration simulator. Gently remove old sleeves and stubborn stickers, use soft brushes to reveal the original holographic shine, and carefully repair bent corners. Finish by placing your renewed masterpiece into a crisp new toploader. Relax and enjoy the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/343684211642a4f67bfdcc55bd9b5748.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/343684211642a4f67bfdcc55bd9b5748.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/343684211642a4f67bfdcc55bd9b5748.mp4?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PACKAGE FROM THE OTHERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you restore orders from various customers, mysterious, unlabelled packages will occasionally arrive at your shop. Eagerly open these surprise deliveries and experience the thrill of uncovering rare cards hidden beneath the dusty layers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/f92137e1abfaf00fb05a416a2a172076.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/f92137e1abfaf00fb05a416a2a172076.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/f92137e1abfaf00fb05a416a2a172076.mp4?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>RE-GRADE YOUR CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buy lowgraded cards, carefully restore them, and get them regraded to achieve a higher score. This allows you to significantly increase their market value and score highly soughtafter cards at a bargain. Keep in mind: rare cards will fetch a massive premium when they reach a top-tier grade!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/baf3d204328e43295c95de8db166d50a.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/baf3d204328e43295c95de8db166d50a.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>COMPLETE YOUR BINDERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You don’t have to sell every rare card you restore. Keep your favorite finds to build your own personal collection! Organize them into dedicated binders by decks and sets, track down missing pieces, and experience the ultimate satisfaction of completing a master set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/acc83010097548ad1d3a5b3e7109fdda.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/acc83010097548ad1d3a5b3e7109fdda.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/acc83010097548ad1d3a5b3e7109fdda.mp4?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNIQUE DECKS AND CARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every single card you encounter features a unique, handcrafted illustration carefully drawn by real artists. When restoring a card, you aren't just cleaning an object; you are bringing a distinct, beautiful piece of art and its unique style back into the light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/771ffb413800822bf8939102844f93a6.poster.avif?t=1787727053\" width=780 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/771ffb413800822bf8939102844f93a6.webm?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/extras/771ffb413800822bf8939102844f93a6.mp4?t=1787727053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "TCG Card Restoration is a restore worn trading cards in this cozy game. Clean dirt, peel stickers, and fix bent corners. Put them in fresh sleeves to grade, sell, or keep in your collection. No time limits, no pressure. Just relax and enjoy the soothing joy of bringing cards back to life!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Greek, Czech, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4816290/339a49378e134481d260cafdeca28ba23f1bb7cc/header.jpg?t=1787727053", "capsule_image": "https://shared.a